@startuml
' Figure 28-3: TriDemo's three left-hand sides interned into ONE DAG. Compile order
' is rule order (SwapRule, WrapRule, FlipRule); children are interned before parents
' (PatternCompiler::compile). Eleven intern() calls produce FIVE canonical states:
' every variable shares one name-free state s0; Swap and Pair share the same two-slot
' invocation shape but remain distinct by constructor; Pair is shared by Wrap and Flip.
' Entry-local boundary maps restore source names. The full trace is 28 §6.2; the count
' is pinned by tridemo_interns_three_rules_into_five_slot_shaped_states_sharing_pair.
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName monospaced
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
top to bottom direction

title Figure 28-3 — TriDemo's alpha-quotiented pattern DAG: 3 rules, 11 raw nodes, 5 states\nshared Var s0 and Pair s2; slot maps preserve linearity and entry names

rectangle "entry 0  PatternId(0)\nSwapRule: <latex>\mathrm{Swap}(a,b)</latex>\nslot_names = [a,b]\nFLAT (M1)" as E0 #EDE7F6
rectangle "entry 1  PatternId(1)\nWrapRule: <latex>\mathrm{Wrap}(\mathrm{Pair}(x,y))</latex>\nslot_names = [x,y]\nNESTED (M2)" as E1 #EDE7F6
rectangle "entry 2  PatternId(2)\nFlipRule: <latex>\mathrm{Flip}(\mathrm{Pair}(x,y))</latex>\nslot_names = [x,y]\nNESTED (M2)" as E2 #EDE7F6

rectangle "<latex>s_1 : \mathrm{App}\{\,\mathrm{Swap},[s_0[0\mapsto0],s_0[0\mapsto1]]\,\}</latex>" as S1 #C3DAF7
rectangle "<latex>s_3 : \mathrm{App}\{\,\mathrm{Wrap},[s_2[0\mapsto0,1\mapsto1]]\,\}</latex>" as S3 #C3DAF7
rectangle "<latex>s_4 : \mathrm{App}\{\,\mathrm{Flip},[s_2[0\mapsto0,1\mapsto1]]\,\}</latex>" as S4 #C3DAF7
rectangle "<latex>s_2 : \mathrm{App}\{\,\mathrm{Pair},[s_0[0\mapsto0],s_0[0\mapsto1]]\,\}</latex>\nSHARED — interned once, hit once" as S2 #9FD3B4
rectangle "<latex>s_0 : \mathrm{Var}</latex>\none canonical slot; name-free" as S0 #C6E0F5

E0 -[#805AD5]-> S1 : root_state
E1 -[#805AD5]-> S3 : root_state
E2 -[#805AD5]-> S4 : root_state
S1 -[#2B6CB0]-> S0 : arg 0 [0->0]
S1 -[#2B6CB0]-> S0 : arg 1 [0->1]
S3 -[#2F855A]-> S2 : arg 0 identity[2]
S4 -[#2F855A]-> S2 : arg 0 identity[2]
S2 -[#2B6CB0]-> S0 : arg 0 [0->0]
S2 -[#2B6CB0]-> S0 : arg 1 [0->1]

note right of S2 #FCF3D0
  WrapRule interns Pair(x,y) as s2 (miss);
  FlipRule's compile of the same sub-pattern
  hits s2 — one node, two parents. Every Var
  hits name-free s0. state_count = 5 = 11 − 6 hits.
  Slot maps distinguish Pair(x,y) from Pair(x,x),
  while entry maps preserve [a,b] and [x,y].
end note

legend bottom
  RootKey dispatch (app_roots): {Swap, arity 2} -> [entry 0]   {Wrap, arity 1} -> [entry 1]   {Flip, arity 1} -> [entry 2]
  entry 0 takes the FLAT (M1) serializer path; entries 1 and 2 take the NESTED (M2) descend-then-collapse path (28 §6.3).
endlegend
@enduml
